# EAS Build upload ignore list.
# When this file exists, EAS uses it INSTEAD of .gitignore to decide what to
# include in the build tarball. Keep the standard ignores below, plus the
# dev-tooling folders that contain symlinks (which fail to pack on Windows with
# EPERM: operation not permitted, symlink).

# ── Standard (mirrors .gitignore) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
npm-debug.*
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
*.orig.*
.DS_Store
expo-env.d.ts
/android/
/ios/
.env.local
.vercel

# ── Dev tooling / AI agent skills (contain symlinks → EPERM on Windows) ───────
.agents/
.claude/
.kiro/
.cursor/

# ── Docs / scratch files not needed in the build ─────────────────────────────
*.md
!README.md
